Ghostty-derived terminal model
------------------------------

Workdeck's Rust terminal-media capture tooling uses qwertty-term-vt, a terminal emulation core
ported from Ghostty. It supplies the VT parser, terminal state machine, page-based scrollback, owned
styled snapshots, dynamic palette state, Unicode graphemes, wide cells, and cursor state consumed by
Workdeck's native PNG renderer.

qwertty-term-vt source: https://github.com/joshka/qwertty-term
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0

Ghostty source: https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty
License: MIT

